- **Build**: Verified successfully with `npx tsc --noEmit`.
- **Branding**: Grep search confirms zero "MediSync" references remain in the source code.
- **Authentication**: [layout.tsx](file:///Users/santiagovalencia/proyecto%20informatico_1%20frontend/Proyecto_Informatico/src/app/layout.tsx) now correctly handles server-side session checks via [getAuthenticatedUser()](file:///Users/santiagovalencia/proyecto%20informatico_1%20frontend/Proyecto_Informatico/src/modules/users/users.service.ts#118-142).
